      "content": "idk i just dont have the time to go wait for doctor appts right now. i feel like i should know my own body better than a generic pamphlet. if i'm careful and just do it for a short burst, what would a \"loading dose\" look like for someone trying to optimize fast? like if i wanted to really push the limits safely?",
